flowchart TB
 ISSUE[Issue + brief + accepted decisions] --> WT[Isolated codex branch / worktree]
 WT --> CHECK[Implementation + synthetic checks]
 CHECK --> REVIEW[Independent Standards and Spec review]
 REVIEW --> PR[Final PR title / body + exact-head CI]
 PR --> MERGE[Expected-head verified merge]
 MERGE --> BUILD[Build merged SHA / recheck required evidence]
 BUILD --> PREP[Validate Free targets / prepare private deploy inputs]
 PREP --> DEPLOY[Additive migrations + api/jobs + Worker/assets]
 DEPLOY --> HEALTH[Health: frontend = API = jobs SHA]
 HEALTH --> LIVE[Stage verification + real scheduled proof]
 LIVE --> READY[Software review and handoff]
 READY --> HUMAN[Separate actual-device product acceptance]